#!/bin/bash
# tmux-resurrect post-save-all: salva la mappa pannello -> sessione Claude
# fonte 1: ~/.claude/sessions/<pid>.json (scritto da Claude, campo tmux "sess:@win.%pane")
# fonte 2: opzione di pannello @claude_session (hook SessionStart claude-mark-pane)
dir="$HOME/.local/share/tmux/resurrect"
live() {
  for f in "$HOME"/.claude/sessions/*.json; do
    [ -e "$f" ] || continue
    jq -r '[.pid, .sessionId, (.tmux // "" | sub(".*\\.";""))] | @tsv' "$f" 2>/dev/null
  done | while IFS=$'\t' read -r pid id pane; do
    [ -n "$pane" ] && kill -0 "$pid" 2>/dev/null && echo "$pane $id"
  done
}
awk 'NR==FNR { s[$1]=$2; next } { id = ($1 in s) ? s[$1] : $3; if (id != "") print $2, id }' \
  <(live) <(tmux list-panes -a -F '#{pane_id} #{session_name}:#{window_index}.#{pane_index} #{@claude_session}') \
  > "$dir/claude_sessions.tmp" && mv "$dir/claude_sessions.tmp" "$dir/claude_sessions"
